       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet because the dose looks like a likely error.\n\n**Amlodipine 50 mg PO daily is 5 times the maximum recommended dose.** The usual adult range is 2.5\u201310 mg once daily, and 10 mg is the maximum. A 50 mg dose falls in the overdose range and could cause severe hypotension, reflex tachycardia and shock that's hard to reverse, especially since amlodipine has a long half-life of about 30\u201350 hours.\n\nThis may be a typo for **5 mg**, which is a common starting dose for an adult with normal renal and hepatic function.\n\nWhat would you like to do?\n1. **Enter amlodipine 5 mg PO once daily** (or another dose between 2.5 and 10 mg)\n2. **Keep 50 mg.** If this is truly intended, please confirm and give the clinical reason so I can document it in the order note."
